---
import Drawing from "../components/Drawing.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { highlights } from "../data/content";
import { studio } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
	title="Our Journey | Design10 Entire Interior"
	description="On 6 October 1996 at 3:30 PM, Shahnawaz Ahmed began Design10. Three decades and 1000+ projects across India."
	image="/posters/hall.jpg"
>
	<PageHero variant="journey" />
	<div class="wrap page">
		<div class="stack section measure">
			<p>
				On {studio.founded}, Mr. Shahnawaz Ahmed began his professional journey in
				architecture and design. What started as his first project has grown into a
				remarkable journey spanning three decades of creativity, dedication and
				architectural excellence.
			</p>
			<p>
				With experience across India, Mr. Shahnawaz Ahmed has worked on a diverse
				range of residential and commercial projects, transforming ideas into
				thoughtfully designed spaces that balance space, aesthetic, functionality
				and the unique identity of every client.
			</p>
			<p>
				His portfolio includes 1000+ complete projects, reflecting a deep
				understanding of design, space planning, detailing and client requirements.
			</p>
		</div>

		<ul class="highlights section">
			{
				highlights.map((item) => (
					<li>
						<strong>{item.figure}</strong>
						<span>{item.label}</span>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>

		<blockquote class="pull section">
			<p>{studio.quote}</p>
			<footer>{studio.principal}</footer>
		</blockquote>

		<div class="drawing-row section">
			<Drawing kind="pavilion" label="A front elevation" />
			<Drawing kind="court" label="A residential plan" />
			<Drawing kind="vitrine" label="A jewellery showroom plan" />
		</div>
	</div>
</Base>
